        {
          "text": "Kandi Salomo yaganza ibihugu vyose vy’abami, uhereye kuri rwa ruzi Efurate, ugashitsa ku gihugu c’Abafilisitiya ukagarukira ku rubibe rwa Egiputa, bakāma bamuzanira amashikanwa, bakamusaba, igihe cose yabaye ku ngoma.",
