          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw abo bamenyekana bama batoza ivyo gutunga umwami Salomo n’abaza kurīra ku meza yiwe bose, umuntu wese uk’ ukwezi kwiwe gutashe; nta kintu na kimwe bāhaza ngo kibure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
