              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw abantu bakava mu mahanga yose bazanywe no kwumva ubgenge bga Salomo, barungitswe n’abami bose bo mw isi bumvise ivy’ ubgenge bgiwe.",
          "type": "text",
